WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.673
A materialized view is fundamentally different from
a standard view The

00:00:05.686 --> 00:00:11.255
materialized view stores query results That can make
repeated

00:00:11.281 --> 00:00:17.025
reads of an expensive summary convenient But the
stored result can become

00:00:17.051 --> 00:00:22.979
stale as base tables change Freshness therefore
becomes part of the object's

00:00:23.005 --> 00:00:23.676
contract
